# Kang the Conqueror: "During that turn, power-up abilities can't be activated." The extra turn is the whole turn, its
# cleanup step too: a trigger there (CR 514.3a) gives players priority in the same turn (CR 500.1), so the restriction
# still holds. Bot1 saves a card each turn until it holds eight on turn 17, casts Kang with the mana it has built (his
# power-up costs {3}{U} the turn he enters) and takes turn 18. Bot1 draws to eight cards, discards one to hand size at
# cleanup and Currency Converter triggers. With that trigger on the stack Bot2, who has Ultron Drone and the six mana for
# its {6} power-up, is refused it (CR 602.5).

